    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96959" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στολ-άς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>,
			ἡ, (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στόλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.3
				</span></i>
			) <i>moving in close array</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λίβυες οἰωνοὶ στολάδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
